The script call versions are
JavaScript:
$gameParty.members().forEach(function(m){
 m.recoverAll();
});
or
JavaScript:
$gameParty.members().forEach(function(m){
 m.gainHp(Math.round(1*(m.mhp)));
 m.gainMp(Math.round(1*(m.mmp)));
});
If you only want to recover a percentage of their HP or MP you would change the 1 to .25 for 25 percent or whatever

